### QUICK TEST - PROCUREMENT & INVOICE FIXES
### Tanggal: 30 Desember 2025

# ============================================
# TEST 1: PROCUREMENT APPROVAL INFO
# ============================================

### 1.1 Get Procurement Detail (Approved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/procurements/:procurement_id
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

# Expected:
# - status: "approved"
# - approver: { full_name, phone_number }
# - approved_at: timestamp
# Frontend harus menampilkan section hijau dengan info approver

### 1.2 Get Procurement Detail (Rejected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/procurements/:procurement_id
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

# Expected:
# - status: "rejected"
# - rejector: { full_name, phone_number }
# - rejected_at: timestamp
# - rejection_reason: "alasan penolakan"
# Frontend harus menampilkan section merah dengan info rejector dan alasan


# ============================================
# TEST 2: INVOICE ORDER OFFLINE
# ============================================

### 2.1 Get Order Detail (Offline)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/:order_id
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

# Expected:
# - order_type: "offline"
# - order_number: "ORD-20251230-XXXX"
# - customer_name, customer_phone
# - payment_method: "cash" / "transfer" / "qris"
# - items array with products

### 2.2 Generate Invoice (Offline Order)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/:order_id/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

# Expected Response:
# - Status: 200 OK
# - Content-Type: text/html
# - Body: HTML invoice dengan:
#   * Header hijau dengan logo BaleTani
#   * Info order (nomor, tanggal, status)
#   * Info customer (nama, telepon, alamat)
#   * Tabel items (produk, qty, harga, subtotal)
#   * Summary (subtotal, ongkir, diskon, total)
#   * Tombol print floating

### 2.3 Generate Invoice (Online Order - Should Work Too)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/:order_id/invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

# Expected:
# - Tetap bisa generate invoice
# - Tapi tombol "Print Invoice" hanya muncul untuk offline orders


# ============================================
# TEST 3: FRONTEND UI
# ============================================

### 3.1 Procurement Detail Modal
# Steps:
# 1. Login sebagai admin
# 2. Buka Procurement List
# 3. Klik detail procurement dengan status "approved"
# 4. Verifikasi muncul:
#    - Section hijau dengan icon check
#    - "Disetujui oleh: [Nama Admin]"
#    - "Tanggal Approval: [DD Mmm YYYY, HH:MM]"
# 
# 5. Kembali ke list
# 6. Klik detail procurement dengan status "rejected"
# 7. Verifikasi muncul:
#    - Section merah dengan icon alert
#    - "Ditolak oleh: [Nama Admin]"
#    - "Tanggal Penolakan: [DD Mmm YYYY, HH:MM]"
#    - "Alasan Penolakan: [Text alasan]"

### 3.2 Order Detail Modal - Print Invoice Button
# Steps:
# 1. Login sebagai admin/cashier
# 2. Buka Order Management
# 3. Klik detail order dengan order_type = "offline"
# 4. Verifikasi tombol "Print Invoice" muncul di footer
#    - Warna hijau
#    - Icon printer
#    - Posisi antara "Close" dan "Update Status"
# 
# 5. Klik tombol "Print Invoice"
# 6. Verifikasi:
#    - Invoice terbuka di tab baru
#    - Toast success muncul: "Invoice dibuka di tab baru. Silakan print."
#    - Invoice tampil dengan design profesional
#    - Ada tombol "Print Invoice" di invoice
# 
# 7. Klik tombol print di invoice
# 8. Verifikasi print dialog muncul

### 3.3 Order Detail Modal - Online Order (No Print Button)
# Steps:
# 1. Buka Order Management
# 2. Klik detail order dengan order_type = "online"
# 3. Verifikasi tombol "Print Invoice" TIDAK muncul
# 4. Hanya ada tombol "Close" dan "Update Status"


# ============================================
# EXPECTED RESULTS SUMMARY
# ============================================

✅ Procurement Detail Modal:
   - Menampilkan info approver dengan background hijau
   - Menampilkan info rejector dengan background merah
   - Menampilkan alasan penolakan (jika ada)

✅ Invoice Order Offline:
   - Endpoint /invoice berfungsi dan return HTML
   - HTML invoice professional dengan CSS embedded
   - Tombol print floating di invoice
   - Informasi lengkap (order, customer, items, payment)

✅ Order Detail Modal:
   - Tombol "Print Invoice" muncul untuk offline orders
   - Tombol berwarna hijau dengan icon printer
   - Klik tombol membuka invoice di tab baru
   - Toast notification muncul

✅ Security:
   - Endpoint dilindungi authenticateAdmin middleware
   - Hanya admin yang bisa akses
